<span id="A1.F16.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F16.3.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="A1.F16.3.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">“A child in a yellow raincoat jumping into a puddle,</span></span>
<span id="A1.F16.3.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F16.3.3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="A1.F16.3.3.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">“holding a red balloon.”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.F16.3.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" colspan="2">
<span id="A1.F16.3.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="A1.F16.3.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F16.3.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="A1.F16.3.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">“A white bear in glasses, wearing tuxedo, glowing hat,</span></span>
<span id="A1.F16.3.3.2.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F16.3.3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="A1.F16.3.3.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">“and with <span id="A1.F16.3.3.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">cigare</span> at the British queen reception.”</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
